---
/** The illustrative assistant conversation — decorative, for the landing
 *  #assistant section. It shows the real shape: a drafted change you approve,
 *  and an email that is its own step with its own confirmation. */
---

<div class="max-w-xl space-y-3" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[90%] rounded-lg rounded-br-sm bg-primary-strong px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-primary-foreground">
    Draft an invoice for Andrea's Flowers — four Flower Kits.
  </div>
  <div class="w-fit max-w-[90%] rounded-lg rounded-bl-sm border border-border bg-background px-4 py-2.5 text-sm">
    <p class="font-medium">Here's the draft — nothing is saved until you approve:</p>
    <p class="mt-1.5 text-muted-foreground">New invoice · Andrea's Flowers · 4 × Flower Kit — $196.00 + $25.48 HST = $221.48</p>
    <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2">
      <span class="rounded-md bg-primary-strong px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-primary-foreground"> Approve </span>
      <span class="rounded-md border border-input px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium">Review changes</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Once it's issued, I can email her the PDF — you'll confirm that separately.</p>
  </div>
</div>
